  "display_title": "The Sweet Savior of the Immoral Beast",
  "description": "Sold as a slave at a young age, Lee's life is a series of cruelty and violence until he meets Asha, a maid sent to his master on an errand. Horrified by his fatal wounds, Asha uses her healing powers to save Lee and helps him flee. Touched by her warmth, Lee vows to serve and guard Asha, while she promises to protect him. But with danger lurking everywhere for this doting duo, can Lee adapt to Asha's innocent world and keep his identity a secret? Or will he ultimately endanger his sweet savior?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
